Package: brave-flags-wrapper
Version: 2.2.0-3
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Depends: bash
Section: web
Priority: optional
Description: Wrapper that applies persistent command-line flags to Brave and Brave Origin
 Diverts the launchers /usr/bin/brave-browser-stable and /usr/bin/brave-origin-stable
 and wraps them so flags from ~/.config/brave-flags.conf are applied, or, if
 that file does not exist, from /etc/brave/brave-flags.conf. The flag files
 themselves are not part of this package. Works whether or not the browsers
 are installed.
